    ],
    "_srcBlendFactor": 770,
    "_dstBlendFactor": 771,
    "_string": "1. To become a VIP, you need to recharge at least 200 Rs. \nThe higher your VIP level,the more privileges you have\n2. The higher the VIP level, the more times and amounts of \nwithdrawals will be made\n3. From the time of the user's last recharge, if the user does \nnot make any recharge in 30 consecutive days, the VIP level \nwill be frozen.Accordingly, the level benefit will not be available, \nand the progressbar will not increase neither.",
    "_N$string": "1. To become a VIP, you need to recharge at least 200 Rs. \nThe higher your VIP level,the more privileges you have\n2. The higher the VIP level, the more times and amounts of \nwithdrawals will be made\n3. From the time of the user's last recharge, if the user does \nnot make any recharge in 30 consecutive days, the VIP level \nwill be frozen.Accordingly, the level benefit will not be available, \nand the progressbar will not increase neither.",
    "_fontSize": 26,
    "_lineHeight": 35,
    "_enableWrapText": true,
